The branch is 57 commits from `main` and touches 64 files, with most risk concentrated in `engine` (ceremonies, admission, querying, probe/preflight) plus the CLI attestation seam. The worktree has an unrelated untracked `.loops/` directory; I’ll leave it untouched. I’m now mapping each contract clause to concrete entry points and tests before attempting adversarial reproductions.
