   469	            # markers read here cannot be raced by another handle: whatever
   470	            # a concurrent writer stamped is already visible, and nothing
   471	            # further can land until we commit or roll back. Increment from
   472	            # that committed value — never from a per-handle cache, which
   473	            # would stamp a stale count over another writer's correct one
   474	            # and brick the store on the next open.
   475	            marked = self._marked_counts()
