   638	def expand_fact_prefix(store_path: Path, prefix: str, *, timeout: float = 5.0) -> str:
   639	    """Resolve a (possibly partial) ``fact:`` id to its full canonical id.
   640	
   641	    Exact-then-prefix resolution over ALL rows (``include_internal`` — witness
   642	    identity is over every row regardless of kind: a ``_decl.*`` row is still a
   643	    valid, addressable position, and the receipt-group guard, not kind, is what
