   309	                f"the atomic receipt group at rowids {span[0]}..{span[1]} — "
   310	                "a declaration edit ceremony is all-or-nothing. Address the "
   311	                f"position at-or-after rowid {span[1]} (the ceremony's last "
   312	                "row) to include the whole edit, or before its first row to "
   313	                "exclude it."
