   424	
   425	    An explicit ``BEGIN``/``ROLLBACK`` — rather than relying on each bare
   426	    ``.execute()`` getting its own implicit auto-transaction, which is what
   427	    a connection with no active transaction gives you in SQLite (every
   428	    top-level statement, SELECT included, is its own mini-transaction
   429	    absent an explicit ``BEGIN``) — is what pins the WAL snapshot across
   430	    the position resolution, the tick count, and the anchor lookup below.

