   758	        machinery, no signer, signatures ride as stored.
   759	
   760	        Returns ``(new_facts, new_ticks, end_offset)`` and stamps
   761	        ``base + new`` — the marker is derived from the committed baseline
   762	        handed in, never from per-handle state.
