   712	        shape (``protocol``, ``documents``, ``chain_head``, ``fact_cursor``),
   713	        the witness-order cursor, and the sign-final-payload rule are the
   714	        contract. ``documents`` are the subject-scoped declaration documents
   715	        (from ``lang.document.vertex_to_documents``); this method stamps the
   716	        protocol and pins around them.
