   842	           current declaration head — the ``(ts, id)`` of the newest
   843	           self-lineage ``_decl.*`` row (genesis included). A mismatch raises
   844	           :class:`StaleDeclarationHead` (rollback): the caller diffed against
   845	           a head that has since moved (concurrent re-absorb), and applying a
   846	           stale diff could leave the store matching neither input file.
   847	        3. Every row in the ceremony shares ONE effective ``ts``, stamped
