    13	
    14	- **`plan_declaration_update(vertex_path, proposed_ast=None, *,
    15	  proposed_text=None)`** → frozen `DeclarationUpdatePreview` exposing:
    16	  declaration status + generation (via `declaration_generation`), canonical
    17	  mode/paths (via `probe_target` + residence — no re-spelled residence
    18	  logic), subject-granular changes (`vertex_to_documents` +
    19	  `diff_documents`), captured declaration head (`store.declaration_head()`,
    20	  token-before-fold-head ordering preserved from the CLI so concurrency
    21	  fails conservative), file-vs-store authority, backend applicability, and
    22	  any pending intent. Proposal is validated (`validate_vertex`) before
    23	  anything — invalid declarations never enter the lineage.
    24	- **`apply_declaration_update(preview, *, observer, credentials=None,
    25	  write_file=None)`** — owns the 8-step protocol. Sequence: durable intent →
    26	  S1b store ceremony (`absorb_genesis` / `absorb_edit(expected_head=…)`,
    27	  which holds CAS + sign-final-payload + append in ONE transaction) → file
    28	  replace → intent removal. Typed results: `applied` / `noop` / `stale`
